    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>Your gift manifests as raw vitality flowing from you into damaged flesh. Some Lifebinders describe seeing a wounded creature as a pattern of light filled with broken threads. Others experience nothing more supernatural than absolute certainty about where life is slipping away.<br>Specialist Skill Vitality Lore<br>Vital Surge: Once per round, when Gift of Healing applies to a creature, you may maximise the result of one healing die rolled by the triggering spell. If the spell restores only a fixed amount of Hit Points and rolls no healing dice, this ability has no additional effect.</p>\n<p>Vital Surge works automatically: once a round, one die of your healing spell is maximised on the card.</p>",
